; Rank-0 data gather is ill-formed: an EMPTY coordinate list leaves the
; output shape underdetermined — "broadcast a scalar to shape S" is the
; empty-index-map VIEW's job, not gather's (ONNX takes the same posture:
; Gather/GatherND require rank >= 1). The premise is STRUCTURAL (the Nil
; constructor), so there is no pending-equality race: Cons and Nil
; classes never union.
(rule
  (
    (= ?out_logical_tensor (LogicalGather ?data_logical (LogicalTensorNil)))
  )
  (
    (panic "LogicalGather with an empty coordinate list (rank-0 data) is ill-formed; scalar broadcast is the empty-index-map view")
  )
)
